.TH TELEBIT 1 "2026-09-09" "telebit" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
telebit \- diagnose the Vietnamese input method path for Fcitx 5
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B telebit doctor
.RI [ \-\-deep ]
.RI [ \-\-markdown ]
.br
.B telebit
.RB [ \-\-version | \-\-help ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B telebit
is the command-line half of Telebit, the Vietnamese Telex/VNI input method for
Fcitx 5. The input method itself is an Fcitx 5 addon and needs no command; this
tool exists to answer the question the addon cannot answer from inside:
whether the input method actually reaches applications.
.PP
It deliberately does not duplicate
.BR fcitx5-diagnose (1),
which is the better tool for locales, immodule caches and Fcitx 5's own
configuration. It covers four things that tool cannot see:
.IP \(bu 3
inside a Flatpak or Snap sandbox, where the input-method module an application
needs either exists or does not;
.IP \(bu 3
the environment the graphical session handed to applications, rather than the
environment of the shell this command runs in;
.IP \(bu 3
which compositor is running, which on Wayland decides the whole correct
configuration;
.IP \(bu 3
that
.B GTK_IM_MODULE
not being set is correct on Plasma and GNOME Wayland, rather than an error.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B doctor
Probe the session, the host, Fcitx 5 and every sandbox, judge the result and
print a report. Exits 0 when nothing failed and 1 when at least one check did,
so it composes in scripts.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-deep
Enter every sandbox and read its environment for real, instead of inferring it
from the sandbox's configuration. The most accurate answer available, at the
cost of one sandbox launch per application.
.TP
.B \-\-markdown
Print a plain, colourless table meant for pasting into a bug report.
.TP
.BR \-\-version ", " \-V
Print the version and exit. It is the same string the addon reports to Fcitx 5.
.TP
.BR \-\-help ", " \-h
Print usage and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
No check failed. Warnings do not affect the exit status.
.TP
.B 1
At least one check failed.
.TP
.B 2
The command line could not be understood.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR telebit-setup (1),
.BR fcitx5 (1),
.BR fcitx5-diagnose (1),
.BR im-config (8)
.PP
Full documentation at
.UR https://sonnam0904.github.io/telebit/
.UE .
